            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehe! ehe! Amucije kuzwa kucisi cakunyika, mbwaamba Jehova. Nkaambo ndamumwaisya mbuli myuuwo yone yakujulu, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehe! Amucijile ku-Zioni, inywe nomukede amwana musimbi wa-Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TH.1.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tes 1:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu iwakandituma. Ulaambila masi aakamusaala, Nkaambo woonse uumuguma ulaguma imboni yaliso lyakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wati, Amubone! Njoozungaanya ijanza lyangu kulimbabo, nkabela bayoosaalwa kumaanza aabantu mbabonya ibakataanguna kubabelekela. Elyo muyooziba ncobeni kuti Jehova wamakamu nguwakandituma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 26:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 6:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imba akusekelela, O mwana musimbi wa-Zioni, nkaambo mebo ndeza kuzookala mulinduwe, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
